<Site title="About Scornis | Student-Led Responsible Innovation" description="Meet Scornis, a multidisciplinary student-led initiative combining curiosity, research, design, and experimentation to explore responsible emerging technologies."><div class="wrap"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">About SCORNIS</p><h1>Building Tomorrow Starts With an Idea.</h1><p>Scornis is a student-led innovation and technology initiative exploring ambitious ideas across multiple disciplines. Our work brings together curiosity, research, design, experimentation, and a willingness to learn.</p><p class="accent">Engineering Ideas Into Tomorrow’s Possibilities.</p></section><ConceptArt label="Original scientific illustration of connected orbital geometry and robotic exploration"/><section class="section split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our vision</p><h2>A more capable tomorrow.</h2><p>To explore and develop meaningful technologies that address real-world challenges and contribute to a more capable, connected, and innovative future.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p><h2>Ideas into tested possibilities.</h2><p>To transform promising ideas into researched, clearly defined, and progressively tested solutions through collaboration, continuous learning, and responsible innovation.</p></div></section><section><h2>Our values</h2><div class="grid">{values.map(([name,text])=><article class="feature"><h3>{name}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="section split"><div><h2>Our focus areas</h2><p>Projects may be at different stages, from early concepts to simulations and implemented features. The project pages distinguish the stated stage from capabilities that still require validation.</p><p>Scornis is presented as a student-led initiative; incorporation, research-institute registration, or corporate status is not claimed.</p></div><ul class="list">{['Aerospace systems and robotics','Artificial intelligence and digital platforms','Marketing intelligence and automation','Interactive educational technology','Food safety monitoring','Biomedical and microrobotics research','Astronaut health monitoring'].map(s=><li>{s}</li>)}</ul></section><section class="cta"><h2>Different perspectives. Shared curiosity.</h2><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="/team">Meet Our Team ↗</a><a class="button" href="/contact">Collaborate With Us</a></div></section></div></Site>